4-HAAD-CONC#,#History of Arch/Art/Design#,#HASS Concentration in History of Architecture, Art, and Design#,#Concentration in History of Architecture, Art, and Design

A concentration requires four subjects: three from Group A (History of Architecture, Art and Design) and one from Group B (Art, Culture & Technology).

group_a, "Group A - History of Architecture, Art, and Design" := 4.601, 4.602, 4.635, 4.636, 4.641, 4.651, 4.657

group_b, "Group B - ACT Group A" := 4.301, 4.302, 4.320, 4.322, 4.341, 4.354

group_a_req, "Three from Group A" := (group_a){>=3}

group_b_req, "One from Group B" := (group_b){>=1}

total, "Total Requirements" := group_a_req, group_b_req

